{{- /*
Generates the search index from the given template and returns the bare name it
was published under - the busted name, with no path.

Expects a dict of `url`, the target path of the generated index, and
`template`, the resource to generate it from.

Only the name comes from here. A deferred template resolves a URL against the
bare site, so anything it worked out about the site root would be wrong for a
site published below a subdirectory; the page prepends its own path instead.
*/}}
{{- $res := resources.Get .template | resources.ExecuteAsTemplate .url site.Home }}
{{- return path.Base (partial "asset.gotmpl" $res).RelPermalink }}